%rec: default
#FIELDS: internal_name role identity routine
#
# One record per Townsperson. Everything here is data — no behaviour is
# hard-coded anywhere.
#
#   role      one of: farmer smith builder trader authority
#   identity  who they are beneath the Role. Never shown to the player; it is
#             what their Private Actions are eventually written against.
#   routine   HH:MM-HH:MM activity place, where place is "x,y" or the name of a
#             location on the map. The Routine is the fixed part of the day and
#             reacts to nothing. Hours it leaves free are spare capacity, which
#             is what limits Reassignment later — so vary it deliberately.

internal_name: shekel
role: trader
identity: keeps two sets of books and is frightened of the elder
routine: 22:00-06:00 sleep 12,9
routine: 06:00-07:00 meal 12,9
routine: 07:00-19:00 trade 17,11
routine: 19:00-22:00 home 12,9

internal_name: abel
role: builder
identity: owes money he cannot repay and is drinking through the debt
routine: 23:00-06:00 sleep 12,15
routine: 06:00-07:00 meal 12,15
routine: 08:00-17:00 build 25,20
routine: 18:00-20:00 tavern 20,13

internal_name: kirioth
role: authority
identity: has been quietly wrong about a judgement for years
routine: 21:00-07:00 sleep 19,17
routine: 07:00-09:00 meal 19,17
routine: 09:00-18:00 court 30,13
routine: 18:00-21:00 home 19,17

internal_name: mary
role: authority
identity: hears everyone's confession and carries all of it alone
routine: 01:00-06:00 sleep 33,18
routine: 06:00-07:00 prayer 33,18
routine: 07:00-12:00 chapel 33,18

internal_name: hanno
role: farmer
identity: feeds two households besides his own and mentions it to no one
routine: 21:00-05:00 sleep 40,13
routine: 05:00-06:00 meal 40,13
routine: 06:00-16:00 fields 47,13

internal_name: greta
role: smith
identity: is the only one who knows who really started the fire
routine: 22:00-06:00 sleep 17,5
routine: 06:00-07:00 meal 17,5
routine: 07:00-18:00 forge 20,6
